Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:40:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1221/1286] HERESY 1169: one decoder on the card: a VAE asked
 for swaps out the idle one, as the LM and the NAR do
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 07.10.2026: «Кликнул на Legacy VAE, за несколько секунд декод успешен, затем на BLEND - сразу OOM… Нужно сторожа поставить на все VAE, чтобы только один декодер в VRAM висел». Each VAE keeps its working buffer (3.1 GB for 1024-frame tiles): Standard, Legacy and Blend side by side ran his 24 GB card out of memory on the third.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/model-store.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/model-store.cpp b/src/model-store.cpp
index 0a82518..e3bb4b8 100644
--- a/src/model-store.cpp
+++ b/src/model-store.cpp
@@ -294,6 +294,10 @@ VAEGGML * store_require_vae(ModelStore * s, const ModelKey & k) {
     }
     if (s->policy == EVICT_STRICT) {
         evict_conflicts(s, k);
+    } else {
+        // Local addition (HERESY 1169): one decoder on the card at a time, as the LM and the NAR above. Each keeps its
+        // working buffer (3.1 GB for 1024-frame tiles), and a third one decoding beside two idle ones ran out of memory
+        evict_same_kind_idle(s, k);
     }
     Timer     t;
     VAEGGML * m = new VAEGGML();
